2026-07-27T08:51:21.8138693Z i /tmp/RtmpRRjSTy/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:51:21.8138997Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:51:21.8139362Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:51:21.8140158Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:51:21.8140645Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:51:21.8141613Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:51:21.8142166Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
